	(lib_symbols)
	(text "THE HARP - sympathetic-string digital pedal, 26-Z04-0005. One four-layer main board in a Hammond 125B on the Alchemist/Relic grid; pots, toggles, LEDs and jacks board-mounted.\nSignal: IN -> K401 -> 1M / 100n -> OPA1656 buffer -> THS4522 ADC driver -> AK4621 -> STM32H750VBT6 (SAI1) -> AK4621 DAC -> OPA1688 difference amps -> OUT L (via K401) and OUT R.\nGENERATED by scripts/harp_schematic/build.py (Timekeeper circuits, Relic bypass). Every connection is a label on a pin stub. Run ERC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
